---
---
<section class="section about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-h">
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <div class="intro" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow accent">About</p>
      <h2 id="about-h">Regulated services are where design earns its keep.</h2>
      <p class="bio">I am Oluwayemi Akinbande, a Senior Service &amp; UX Designer in Calgary, Alberta. Seven years across fintech, healthcare, energy and SaaS, with a specialism in services that are government-funded, regulated, or used by the public.</p>
      <p class="bio">The work I am best at is the unglamorous kind: intake that stands up to audit, operations platforms a whole organisation runs on, design systems a team keeps using after handoff. I design the service model and the information architecture before the interface, and stay through to production so the spec and the shipped product are the same thing.</p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:hello@yemmy.design">hello@yemmy.design</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/akinoluwayemi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cards" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.15">
      <div class="panel card avail">
        <span class="open"><i class="ring" aria-hidden="true"></i>Open to work</span>
        <h3>Senior service and UX design roles, and freelance or contract engagements.</h3>
        <p>Canada or remote. Government-funded, regulated and citizen-facing services first.</p>
      </div>
      <dl class="panel card facts">
        <div><dt>Based</dt><dd>Calgary, Alberta</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Standards</dt><dd>WCAG 2.2 AA, design tokens, component libraries, design governance</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Sectors</dt><dd>Government-funded care, digital government, healthcare, fintech, energy, SaaS</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, 0.9fr); gap: clamp(32px, 5vw, 80px); align-items: start; }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 44px); margin: 14px 0 22px; max-width: 16ch; }
  .bio { color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; max-width: 56ch; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .cta { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 26px; }
  .cards { display: grid; gap: 14px; }
  .card { padding: clamp(22px, 2.6vw, 30px); }
  .avail { display: grid; gap: 12px; border-color: rgba(61,214,140,0.22); background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(61,214,140,0.06), var(--surface) 55%); }
  .open { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ok); }
  .ring { position: relative; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--ok); flex: none; }
  .ring::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: -6px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid var(--ok); animation: ring 2.2s ease-out infinite; }
  @keyframes ring { 0% { transform: scale(0.4); opacity: 0.9; } 100% { transform: scale(1.6); opacity: 0; } }
  .avail h3 { font-size: clamp(18px, 1.8vw, 22px); line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .avail p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .facts { margin: 0; padding: 6px 0; }
  .facts > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr; gap: 16px; padding: 16px clamp(22px, 2.6vw, 30px); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-a); }
  .facts > div:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  dt { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10.5px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--dim); padding-top: 3px; }
  dd { margin: 0; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--fg); }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .facts > div { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 6px; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .ring::after { animation: none; opacity: 0.5; transform: scale(1.2); } }
</style>
